oNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-list:\r\n     l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:\r\n     bold\">Maciej Miecznikowski<\/span><o:p><\/o:p><\/font><\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt;\"><font size=\"4\">Wiecz\u00f3r ten b\u0119dzie okazj\u0105 do spotkania z\r\nmuzyk\u0105, kt\u00f3ra od lat porusza kolejne pokolenia s\u0142uchaczy, w wyj\u0105tkowej i pe\u0142nej\r\nemocji ods\u0142onie.<\/font><o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"KONCERT","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"0","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/305\/1787662353.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":11,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce - miejsca dostawki","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":2,"location_type_name":"otwarte","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2573":{"id":2573,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA  Tani Poniedzia\u0142ek","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-28-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789655705.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 13:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":4,"name":"BILET NA TANI PONIEDZIA\u0141EK","rawPrice":1400,"price":"14,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":467,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<font size=\"4\">Jedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.<\/font><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Belgia, Francja\/2026<\/span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Familijny, Przygodowy, Animacja<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789655705.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2581":{"id":2581,"title":"FOLWARK ZWIERZ\u0118CY  Tani Poniedzia\u0142ek","url":"\/kup-bilet\/folwark-zwierzecy-2026-09-28-15-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789656190.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T15:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 15:30:00"},"products":[{"id":4,"name":"BILET NA TANI PONIEDZIA\u0141EK","rawPrice":1400,"price":"14,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":468,"name":"FOLWARK ZWIERZ\u0118CY ","description":"<p style=\"padding-top: 0px; margin-top: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"4\">Wizjonerski re\u017cyser Andy Serkis przedstawia ekranizacj\u0119 \"Folwarku zwierz\u0119cego\" - klasycznego dzie\u0142a George\u2019a Orwella, odczytane na nowo z my\u015bl\u0105 o wsp\u00f3\u0142czesnym widzu, tak\u017ce najm\u0142odszym, i wyzwaniach dzisiejszego \u015bwiata.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"4\">Gdy zwierz\u0119ta przejmuj\u0105 w\u0142adz\u0119 nad farm\u0105, wierz\u0105, \u017ce wsp\u00f3lnie stworz\u0105 miejsce, w kt\u00f3rym wszyscy b\u0119d\u0105 r\u00f3wni i szcz\u0119\u015bliwi. Z czasem jednak dobre intencje ust\u0119puj\u0105 miejsca ambicji, a ci, kt\u00f3rzy mieli s\u0142u\u017cy\u0107 innym, zaczynaj\u0105 dba\u0107 przede wszystkim o w\u0142asne interesy. Dawne zasady zostaj\u0105 zmienione, prawda przestaje mie\u0107 znaczenie, a marzenie o sprawiedliwym \u015bwiecie powoli zamienia si\u0119 w rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 pe\u0142n\u0105 podzia\u0142\u00f3w i niesprawiedliwo\u015bci. To poruszaj\u0105ca i ponadczasowa opowie\u015b\u0107 o tym, jak \u0142atwo zatraci\u0107 idea\u0142y, gdy w gr\u0119 wchodz\u0105 w\u0142adza i w\u0142asne ambicje.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Kanada, Wielka Brytania\/2025&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Komedia, Przygodowy, Animacja<\/span><\/p>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789656190.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2577":{"id":2577,"title":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS  Tani Poniedzia\u0142ek","url":"\/kup-bilet\/100-dni-misja-zeus-2026-09-28-17-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/469\/1789656497.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T17:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 16:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 17:15:00"},"products":[{"id":4,"name":"BILET NA TANI PONIEDZIA\u0141EK","rawPrice":1400,"price":"14,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":469,"name":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","description":"<span style=\"font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, Arial; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Kontynuacja jednego z najg\u0142o\u015bniejszych m\u0142odzie\u017cowych film\u00f3w ostatnich lat. Tym razem bohaterowie wychodz\u0105 poza szkolne mury, a stawka jest wi\u0119ksza ni\u017c kiedykolwiek wcze\u015bniej - cho\u0107 oni sami nie czuj\u0105 si\u0119 na ni\u0105 gotowi. Kapsel i jego ekipa stawiaj\u0105 pierwsze kroki w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu. Jedni ruszyli ju\u017c dalej, inni pr\u00f3buj\u0105 pouk\u0142ada\u0107 \u017cycie po swojemu, a Kapsel\u2026 nie potrafi si\u0119 odnale\u017a\u0107. Mieszka z rodzicami, w pracy po\u017cegna\u0142 si\u0119 z ambicjami i coraz cz\u0119\u015bciej zadaje sobie pytanie, czy najlepszy czas ma za sob\u0105. Kiedy jednak na horyzoncie pojawia si\u0119 misja, od kt\u00f3rej mo\u017ce zale\u017ce\u0107 przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 wielu ludzi, nie ma czasu na w\u0105tpliwo\u015bci.<\/span><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Polska\/2026&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Komedia, Akcja<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":110,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/469\/1789656497.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2585":{"id":2585,"title":"MA TO SENS  Tani Poniedzia\u0142ek","url":"\/kup-bilet\/ma-to-sens-2026-09-28-19-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/470\/1789657233.jpg","date":"2026-09-28T19:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-28 18:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-28 19:15:00"},"products":[{"id":4,"name":"BILET NA TANI PONIEDZIA\u0141EK","rawPrice":1400,"price":"14,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":470,"name":"MA TO SENS ","description":"<font size=\"4\">Antoni (J\u0119drzej Hycnar) zrobi\u0142 wszystko, aby \u015bwiat da\u0142 mu wreszcie \u015bwi\u0119ty spok\u00f3j. Znalaz\u0142 cich\u0105 prac\u0119 i ograniczy\u0142 kontakty z innymi do absolutnego minimum. I wtedy pojawi\u0142a si\u0119 Olga (Olga Kalicka). Najpierw zdemolowa\u0142a magazyn w\u00f3zkiem wid\u0142owym. Potem uzna\u0142a Antoniego za swojego najlepszego kumpla. Teraz, im bardziej on pr\u00f3buje trzyma\u0107 j\u0105 na dystans, tym bardziej ona zachowuje si\u0119, jakby znali si\u0119 od lat. On patrzy na ni\u0105 jak na kosmitk\u0119. Ona na niego jak na cz\u0142owieka, kt\u00f3rego trzeba uratowa\u0107. Jakim cudem ci dwoje s\u0105 w stanie ze sob\u0105 wytrzyma\u0107? Mo\u017ce takim, \u017ce opr\u00f3cz sk\u0142onno\u015bci do wpadania w k\u0142opoty, Olga ma r\u00f3wnie\u017c talent do pieczenia chleba.<\/font><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok: <\/span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Polska\/2026&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Dramat, Komedia<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":92,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/470\/1789657233.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2571":{"id":2571,"title":"PODR\u0118CZNIK DLA SUPERBOHATER\u00d3W ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/podrecznik-dla-superbohaterow-2026-09-29-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789655280.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 13:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"BILET NORMALNY DO KINA","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":466,"name":"PODR\u0118CZNIK DLA SUPERBOHATER\u00d3W ","description":"<p style=\"padding-top: 0px; margin-top: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"4\">Nowa w Rosenhill Lisa odkrywa podr\u0119cznik supermocy, zostaje superbohaterk\u0105 i musi po\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 si\u0142y z dawnymi prze\u015bladowcami, by powstrzyma\u0107 gangstera Wolfganga i ocali\u0107 miasto.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"4\">10-letnia Lisa \u017cyje w niewielkim miasteczku. Jest prze\u015bladowana przez r\u00f3wie\u015bnik\u00f3w i nie ma przyjaci\u00f3\u0142. Pewnego dnia znajduje ksi\u0105\u017ck\u0119 - \"Podr\u0119cznik dla Superbohater\u00f3w\". Lisa ka\u017cd\u0105 woln\u0105 chwil\u0119 sp\u0119dza na nauce \"superbohaterstwa\" i przybiera pseudonim \"Czerwona Maska\". Wkr\u00f3tce b\u0119dzie musia\u0142a stoczy\u0107 swoj\u0105 pierwsz\u0105 walk\u0119 ze z\u0142em i ze swoimi l\u0119kami. Szybko nauczy si\u0119, \u017ce prawdziwe bohaterstwo tkwi we wsp\u00f3\u0142czuciu i odwadze.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Norwegia, Szwecja\/2025&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Familijny, Animacja<\/span><\/p>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":91,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789655280.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2582":{"id":2582,"title":"FOLWARK ZWIERZ\u0118CY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/folwark-zwierzecy-2026-09-29-15-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789656190.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T15:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 15:30:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"BILET NORMALNY DO KINA","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":468,"name":"FOLWARK ZWIERZ\u0118CY ","description":"<p style=\"padding-top: 0px; margin-top: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"4\">Wizjonerski re\u017cyser Andy Serkis przedstawia ekranizacj\u0119 \"Folwarku zwierz\u0119cego\" - klasycznego dzie\u0142a George\u2019a Orwella, odczytane na nowo z my\u015bl\u0105 o wsp\u00f3\u0142czesnym widzu, tak\u017ce najm\u0142odszym, i wyzwaniach dzisiejszego \u015bwiata.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font size=\"4\">Gdy zwierz\u0119ta przejmuj\u0105 w\u0142adz\u0119 nad farm\u0105, wierz\u0105, \u017ce wsp\u00f3lnie stworz\u0105 miejsce, w kt\u00f3rym wszyscy b\u0119d\u0105 r\u00f3wni i szcz\u0119\u015bliwi. Z czasem jednak dobre intencje ust\u0119puj\u0105 miejsca ambicji, a ci, kt\u00f3rzy mieli s\u0142u\u017cy\u0107 innym, zaczynaj\u0105 dba\u0107 przede wszystkim o w\u0142asne interesy. Dawne zasady zostaj\u0105 zmienione, prawda przestaje mie\u0107 znaczenie, a marzenie o sprawiedliwym \u015bwiecie powoli zamienia si\u0119 w rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 pe\u0142n\u0105 podzia\u0142\u00f3w i niesprawiedliwo\u015bci. To poruszaj\u0105ca i ponadczasowa opowie\u015b\u0107 o tym, jak \u0142atwo zatraci\u0107 idea\u0142y, gdy w gr\u0119 wchodz\u0105 w\u0142adza i w\u0142asne ambicje.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Kanada, Wielka Brytania\/2025&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Komedia, Przygodowy, Animacja<\/span><\/p>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789656190.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2578":{"id":2578,"title":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/100-dni-misja-zeus-2026-09-29-17-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/469\/1789656497.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T17:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 16:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 17:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"BILET NORMALNY DO KINA","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":469,"name":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","description":"<span style=\"font-family: &quot;PT Sans&quot;, Arial; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Kontynuacja jednego z najg\u0142o\u015bniejszych m\u0142odzie\u017cowych film\u00f3w ostatnich lat. Tym razem bohaterowie wychodz\u0105 poza szkolne mury, a stawka jest wi\u0119ksza ni\u017c kiedykolwiek wcze\u015bniej - cho\u0107 oni sami nie czuj\u0105 si\u0119 na ni\u0105 gotowi. Kapsel i jego ekipa stawiaj\u0105 pierwsze kroki w doros\u0142ym \u017cyciu. Jedni ruszyli ju\u017c dalej, inni pr\u00f3buj\u0105 pouk\u0142ada\u0107 \u017cycie po swojemu, a Kapsel\u2026 nie potrafi si\u0119 odnale\u017a\u0107. Mieszka z rodzicami, w pracy po\u017cegna\u0142 si\u0119 z ambicjami i coraz cz\u0119\u015bciej zadaje sobie pytanie, czy najlepszy czas ma za sob\u0105. Kiedy jednak na horyzoncie pojawia si\u0119 misja, od kt\u00f3rej mo\u017ce zale\u017ce\u0107 przysz\u0142o\u015b\u0107 wielu ludzi, nie ma czasu na w\u0105tpliwo\u015bci.<\/span><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Polska\/2026&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Komedia, Akcja<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":110,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/469\/1789656497.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2586":{"id":2586,"title":"MA TO SENS ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/ma-to-sens-2026-09-29-19-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/470\/1789657233.jpg","date":"2026-09-29T19:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-29 18:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-29 19:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"BILET NORMALNY DO KINA","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":470,"name":"MA TO SENS ","description":"<font size=\"4\">Antoni (J\u0119drzej Hycnar) zrobi\u0142 wszystko, aby \u015bwiat da\u0142 mu wreszcie \u015bwi\u0119ty spok\u00f3j. Znalaz\u0142 cich\u0105 prac\u0119 i ograniczy\u0142 kontakty z innymi do absolutnego minimum. I wtedy pojawi\u0142a si\u0119 Olga (Olga Kalicka). Najpierw zdemolowa\u0142a magazyn w\u00f3zkiem wid\u0142owym. Potem uzna\u0142a Antoniego za swojego najlepszego kumpla. Teraz, im bardziej on pr\u00f3buje trzyma\u0107 j\u0105 na dystans, tym bardziej ona zachowuje si\u0119, jakby znali si\u0119 od lat. On patrzy na ni\u0105 jak na kosmitk\u0119. Ona na niego jak na cz\u0142owieka, kt\u00f3rego trzeba uratowa\u0107. Jakim cudem ci dwoje s\u0105 w stanie ze sob\u0105 wytrzyma\u0107? Mo\u017ce takim, \u017ce opr\u00f3cz sk\u0142onno\u015bci do wpadania w k\u0142opoty, Olga ma r\u00f3wnie\u017c talent do pieczenia chleba.<\/font><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok: <\/span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Polska\/2026&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Dramat, Komedia<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":92,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/470\/1789657233.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2579":{"id":2579,"title":"100 DNI: MISJA ZEUS ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/100-dni-misja-zeus-2026-09-30-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/469\/1789656497.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 13:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"BILET NORMALNY DO KINA","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00",