e zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/font><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:<\/span> <span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box;\">Polska\/2026<\/span>&nbsp;<\/span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Gatunek:<\/span>&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Kostiumowy, Dramat obyczajowy<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1788527340.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2590":{"id":2590,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-10-02-14-15","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789655705.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T14:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":189,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 13:45:00","startAt":"2026-09-17 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 14:15:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"BILET NORMALNY DO KINA","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":189}]},"event":{"id":467,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<font size=\"4\">Jedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.<\/font><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Belgia, Francja\/2026<\/span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>Gatunek:&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Familijny, Przygodowy, Animacja<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1789655705.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2505":{"id":2505,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-16-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1788527340.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":187,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-04 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"BILET NORMALNY DO KINA","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":187}]},"event":{"id":456,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<font size=\"4\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/font><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:<\/span> <span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box;\">Polska\/2026<\/span>&nbsp;<\/span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Gatunek:<\/span>&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Kostiumowy, Dramat obyczajowy<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":