ily: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:<\/span> <span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box;\">Polska\/2026<\/span>&nbsp;<\/span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Gatunek:<\/span>&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Kostiumowy, Dramat obyczajowy<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"FILM","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1788527340.jpg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":3,"name":"Kino Na Star\u00f3wce","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"ul. Ko\u015bciuszki 3"}},"2325":{"id":2325,"title":"WIECZ\u00d3R \u017bEGLARSKO-FOLKOWY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/wieczor-zeglarsko-folkowy-2026-10-09-19-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/424\/1784639933.jpeg","date":"2026-10-09T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":103,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":null,"info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-09 18:30:00","startAt":"2026-07-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-09 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":141,"name":"DK Wiecz\u00f3r \u017beglarsko-Folkowy","rawPrice":5000,"price":"50,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":103}]},"event":{"id":424,"name":"WIECZ\u00d3R \u017bEGLARSKO-FOLKOWY ","description":"<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1218\"><br><\/p><p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1218\">Pierwszy dzie\u0144 festiwalu\r\n        b\u0119dzie gratk\u0105 dla mi\u0142o\u015bnik\u00f3w muzyki \u017ceglarskiej i folkowej.<\/p><p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1432\">Na scenie Domu Kultury\r\n        wyst\u0105pi <strong data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1272\">Orkiestra\r\n          Samanta<\/strong> \u2013 jeden z najbardziej cenionych polskich\r\n        zespo\u0142\u00f3w folkowo-szantowych, od ponad dw\u00f3ch dekad \u0142\u0105cz\u0105cy\r\n        tradycyjne pie\u015bni morza z rockow\u0105 energi\u0105 i muzyk\u0105 celtyck\u0105.<\/p><p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1432\"><br><\/p>\r\n      <p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1629\">Nast\u0119pnie publiczno\u015b\u0107 us\u0142yszy\r\n        legendarny zesp\u00f3\u0142 <strong data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1492\">4\r\n          Refy<\/strong>, kt\u00f3ry od ponad 40 lat nale\u017cy do czo\u0142\u00f3wki\r\n        polskiej sceny szantowej i ma na swoim koncie setki koncert\u00f3w\r\n        oraz liczne wydawnictwa p\u0142ytowe.<\/p>\r\n      <p data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1919\">Wiecz\u00f3r zako\u0144czy jubileuszowy\r\n        koncert <strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1691\">\u201e25 lat na\r\n          scenie\u201d<\/strong> zespo\u0142u <strong data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1712\">S\u0105siedzi<\/strong> \u2013 jednej z najbardziej\r\n        rozpoznawalnych grup wykonuj\u0105cych muzyk\u0119 folk &amp; shanties.\r\n        Zesp\u00f3\u0142 od lat zachwyca publiczno\u015b\u0107 doskona\u0142ymi aran\u017cacjami,\r\n        wielog\u0142osowymi harmoniami i niezwyk\u0142\u0105 atmosfer\u0105 swoich\r\n        koncert\u00f3w.<\/p>\r\n      <p data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1933\"><strong data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1933\">Program:<\/strong><\/p>\r\n      <ul data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2071\"><li data-section-id=\"hvaudd\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\n          19:00 \u2013 rozpocz\u0119cie koncertu <\/li><li data-section-id=\"p0s02u\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1992\">\r\n          19:15 \u2013 Orkiestra Samanta <\/li><li data-section-id=\"1vhe4d8\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2009\">\r\n          20:30 \u2013 4 Refy <\/li><li data-section-id=\"10a6wi3\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2049\">\r\n          21:45 \u2013 S\u0105siedzi \u2013 \u201e25 lat na scenie\u201d <\/li><li data-section-id=\"jr50lh\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n          23:00 \u2013 zako\u0144czenie <\/li><\/ul>\r\n      <p data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2089\"><strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2089\">Bilet: 50 z\u0142<\/strong><\/p>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"0","duration":240,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/424\/1784639933.jpeg","artists":[]},"organizer":{"id":1,"name":"MOK \u017bory","officialName":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","street":"ul. Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1","city":"\u017bory","postCode":"44-240","nip":"651-00-09-658","www":null},"location":{"id":4,"name":"Sala Teatralna","institution_name":"Miejski O\u015brodek Kultury w \u017borach","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"\u017bory","city_id":2332,"zip":"44-240","addresse":"Dolne Przedmie\u015bcie 1"}},"2559":{"id":2559,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-10-15-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1788527340.jpg","date":"2026-10-10T15:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":187,"additionalInfo":"","regulationsUrl":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-10 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-04 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-10 15:30:00"},"products":[{"id":2,"name":"BILET NORMALNY DO KINA","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","saleMultiple":0,"allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":187}]},"event":{"id":456,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<font size=\"4\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/font><div><span style=\"font-family: Lato, Arial; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Produkcja\/rok:<\/span> <span style=\"font-family: &quot;Titillium Web&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Verdana, Arial, Tahoma; box-sizing: bor